cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite this software release."
type: software
title: "Kuratowski's theorem in Lean 4"
authors:
  - alias: "Maokami"
    website: "https://github.com/Maokami"
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Maokami/kuratowski-lean"
url: "https://github.com/Maokami/kuratowski-lean"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - graph theory
  - Kuratowski theorem
  - rotation systems
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 proof of both directions of Kuratowski's theorem for finite simple
  graphs, with planarity defined combinatorially by genus-zero rotation systems.
  Disconnected graphs and isolated vertices are included. The correspondence
  with topological embeddings is not formalized.
